Place ML model files here:

1. ggml-base.en.bin (~150MB) - Whisper speech-to-text model
   Download from: https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp/tree/main

2. fer_expression.onnx (~10MB) - Facial expression recognition model
   Search "facial expression recognition onnx" on HuggingFace

3. hand_landmark.onnx (~5MB) - Hand landmark detection model
   MediaPipe hand landmark model exported to ONNX
